@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+`order-triage`
+
+Classify each incoming order for human review. Classify an order as `refund-review` when its `orderId` starts with `R-`; otherwise classify it as `fulfillment`. Always set `requiresHumanReview` to `true`.
+
+Do not approve refunds or make account changes.
